1
00:00:02,072 --> 00:00:05,972
Season five follows the fifth book, Nemesis Games.

2
00:00:06,037 --> 00:00:08,837
After Ilus, the Rocinante needs repairs

3
00:00:08,857 --> 00:00:10,337
at Tycho Station,

4
00:00:10,357 --> 00:00:11,457
so for the first time,

5
00:00:11,477 --> 00:00:13,007
the crew splits up.

6
00:00:13,027 --> 00:00:14,032
Each of them goes off

7
00:00:14,052 --> 00:00:16,282
to face something from their past.

8
00:00:16,302 --> 00:00:19,132
Meanwhile, a Belter named Marco Inaros

9
00:00:19,152 --> 00:00:21,332
is planning something huge.

10
00:00:21,352 --> 00:00:23,107
Four stories, one crew,

11
00:00:23,127 --> 00:00:25,332
scattered across the solar system.

12
00:00:25,352 --> 00:00:26,675
Spoilers ahead!

13
00:00:27,404 --> 00:00:29,409
Story one: Holden.

14
00:00:29,429 --> 00:00:31,859
While the Rocinante is being fixed,

15
00:00:31,879 --> 00:00:34,759
a documentary maker named Monica Stuart brings

16
00:00:34,779 --> 00:00:36,084
him a mystery.

17
00:00:36,104 --> 00:00:37,984
Colony ships heading for the gates

18
00:00:38,004 --> 00:00:40,134
are vanishing without a trace.

19
00:00:40,154 --> 00:00:42,834
Holden doesn't think aliens are taking them.

20
00:00:42,854 --> 00:00:45,009
He suspects Belter radicals.

21
00:00:45,029 --> 00:00:46,909
He traces one ship to a cluster

22
00:00:46,929 --> 00:00:48,334
of rocks near Mars,

23
00:00:48,354 --> 00:00:50,564
and sends the coordinates to Alex.

24
00:00:51,274 --> 00:00:53,804
Then Marco strikes everywhere at once.

25
00:00:53,824 --> 00:00:55,549
His Free Navy hits Earth,

26
00:00:55,569 --> 00:00:57,999
Mars, and the stations of the Belt.

27
00:00:58,019 --> 00:01:00,199
On Tycho, attackers steal

28
00:01:00,219 --> 00:01:02,799
the last protomolecule sample.

29
00:01:02,819 --> 00:01:04,474
Holden and Fred Johnson hold

30
00:01:04,494 --> 00:01:05,739
the station together,

31
00:01:05,759 --> 00:01:07,489
but Holden is stuck there,

32
00:01:07,509 --> 00:01:08,814
cut off from his crew,

33
00:01:08,834 --> 00:01:11,724
with no idea where Naomi went or why.

34
00:01:12,433 --> 00:01:14,388
Story two: Naomi.

35
00:01:14,408 --> 00:01:16,733
She gets a message from Marco Inaros,

36
00:01:16,753 --> 00:01:19,133
the man she was with when she was young.

37
00:01:19,153 --> 00:01:20,313
Years ago, he tricked

38
00:01:20,333 --> 00:01:23,658
her into writing code that killed hundreds of people.

39
00:01:23,683 --> 00:01:24,688
They had a son,

40
00:01:24,708 --> 00:01:27,343
Filip, and Marco took him away from her.

41
00:01:27,363 --> 00:01:29,118
Now Filip is in trouble,

42
00:01:29,138 --> 00:01:31,818
so Naomi leaves for Ceres alone,

43
00:01:31,838 --> 00:01:33,725
without telling Holden why.

44
00:01:34,391 --> 00:01:35,646
It's a trap.

45
00:01:35,666 --> 00:01:36,921
Marco planned it all,

46
00:01:36,941 --> 00:01:38,556
with Filip as the bait,

47
00:01:38,576 --> 00:01:39,731
and Filip is now one

48
00:01:39,751 --> 00:01:41,606
of Marco's soldiers.

49
00:01:41,626 --> 00:01:44,226
Naomi becomes Marco's prisoner.

50
00:01:44,296 --> 00:01:45,851
He leaves her on a ship rigged

51
00:01:45,871 --> 00:01:48,126
to explode when the Rocinante comes

52
00:01:48,146 --> 00:01:49,426
to save her.

53
00:01:49,446 --> 00:01:50,901
Naomi gets out,

54
00:01:50,921 --> 00:01:51,951
sends a warning,

55
00:01:51,971 --> 00:01:53,876
and drifts in space until Alex

56
00:01:53,896 --> 00:01:55,306
and Bobbie pick her up.

57
00:01:56,049 --> 00:01:58,179
Story three: Amos.

58
00:01:58,199 --> 00:02:00,054
He flies to Earth after the death

59
00:02:00,074 --> 00:02:01,554
of Lydia, the woman who took him

60
00:02:01,574 --> 00:02:03,124
in when he was young.

61
00:02:03,149 --> 00:02:04,679
He goes back to Baltimore,

62
00:02:04,699 --> 00:02:06,974
the hard streets where he grew up.

63
00:02:06,999 --> 00:02:09,629
He also visits Clarissa Mao in prison,

64
00:02:09,649 --> 00:02:10,779
the woman who once tried

65
00:02:10,799 --> 00:02:12,179
to kill Holden.

66
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:14,029
Then the sky falls.

67
00:02:14,049 --> 00:02:17,223
Marco's stealth-coated rocks slam into Earth.

68
00:02:17,895 --> 00:02:21,100
The impacts kill hundreds of millions of people.

69
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,025
Clarissa's prison breaks open,

70
00:02:23,045 --> 00:02:25,245
and Amos takes her with him.

71
00:02:25,295 --> 00:02:27,625
With help from old friends of Amos,

72
00:02:27,645 --> 00:02:29,650
they cross a shattered Earth and fight

73
00:02:29,670 --> 00:02:32,225
their way onto a ship to space.

74
00:02:32,245 --> 00:02:34,725
Clarissa, who came to the Rocinante

75
00:02:34,745 --> 00:02:35,775
as an enemy,

76
00:02:35,795 --> 00:02:37,325
comes back to it as a member

77
00:02:37,345 --> 00:02:38,286
of the crew.

78
00:02:39,015 --> 00:02:41,145
Story four: Alex.

79
00:02:41,165 --> 00:02:42,595
He flies to Mars,

80
00:02:42,615 --> 00:02:44,625
hoping to make peace with his ex-wife,

81
00:02:44,645 --> 00:02:46,595
but she doesn't want to see him.

82
00:02:46,635 --> 00:02:48,480
There he meets Bobbie Draper,

83
00:02:48,500 --> 00:02:51,380
out of the Marines and working with veterans.

84
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,605
Bobbie has noticed that Martian warships

85
00:02:53,625 --> 00:02:54,950
are going missing,

86
00:02:54,970 --> 00:02:57,650
sold off by people inside the navy.

87
00:02:57,670 --> 00:02:59,546
Then someone tries to kill her.

88
00:03:00,236 --> 00:03:02,141
Using Holden's coordinates,

89
00:03:02,161 --> 00:03:04,666
Alex and Bobbie fly the Razorback,

90
00:03:04,686 --> 00:03:07,116
Julie Mao's old racing ship.

91
00:03:07,136 --> 00:03:08,416
They find a hidden fleet

92
00:03:08,436 --> 00:03:10,516
of stolen Martian warships,

93
00:03:10,536 --> 00:03:13,641
the ships Marco's Free Navy is built from.

94
00:03:13,661 --> 00:03:17,311
Marco attacks the Martian Prime Minister's convoy,

95
00:03:17,331 --> 00:03:20,436
and Alex and Bobbie barely survive the battle.

96
00:03:20,456 --> 00:03:22,694
Then they race to rescue Naomi.

97
00:03:23,416 --> 00:03:24,696
Season five ends

98
00:03:24,716 --> 00:03:25,946
with the crew back together

99
00:03:25,966 --> 00:03:27,071
on the Rocinante,

100
00:03:27,091 --> 00:03:29,446
with Bobbie and Clarissa aboard.

101
00:03:29,466 --> 00:03:30,721
Earth is wounded,

102
00:03:30,741 --> 00:03:32,046
and Marco's Free Navy

103
00:03:32,066 --> 00:03:34,021
has seized Medina Station,

104
00:03:34,041 --> 00:03:36,146
the hub inside the Ring.

105
00:03:36,166 --> 00:03:37,331
Leaders of Earth,

106
00:03:37,351 --> 00:03:38,681
Mars, and the Belt meet

107
00:03:38,701 --> 00:03:39,856
on the Moon to plan

108
00:03:39,876 --> 00:03:41,276
what comes next.

109
00:03:41,371 --> 00:03:42,826
And something inside the gates

110
00:03:42,846 --> 00:03:45,376
has started making ships disappear.

111
00:03:45,396 --> 00:03:47,535
Next up: season six.

